LegaParse SELECTOR, frozen before the holdout that tests it.

WHAT IS FROZEN: relation extraction, concern resolution, role projection, subgraph emission, site
semantics and the two-axis score. No file below may change before the prospective run; if one must,
the run is a new preregistration, not a continuation of this one.

CONDITION OF THE FREEZE: the abstraction-defect sweep found no UNLABELLED conflation of the three
fact kinds remaining. One convention (strongest-role summarization) is labelled and UNDETERMINED on
real data - see CONCERNS.md. It is not a known-wrong fact; it is an unsettled one.

a03 stands at EQUIVALENT, 0.00 bits. That is the honest reading: the current program constrains the
placement no further, and the remaining constraint belongs to transaction topology, which this
component deliberately does not know.

